	(gr_text "FABRICATION\nJLCPCB 4 layers, 1.6 mm, stackup JLC04161H-7628, 1 oz outer / 0.5 oz inner, ENIG.\nVias tented; the exposed-pad vias of IC4, IC8 and IC9 stay open (their paste windows keep clear of the holes).\nImpedance control +-10 %: L1/L4 100 ohm differential, 0.21 mm / 0.19 mm gap (Ethernet TRD*, CSI DPHY0_*);\nL1 90 ohm differential, 0.24 mm / 0.15 mm gap (USB). Min track 0.1 mm, min via 0.45/0.2 mm.\nNo V-score or panel rail on the edge next to J7/J1/J5: IC5's courtyard is 0.1 mm from it.\n\nASSEMBLY\nU5 (Ag59824-LPB, bottom) must never reflow hanging upside down: reflow the top side first,\nthen the bottom side with IC5 last and upright, or fit IC5 by hot air afterwards.\nGlue dot under L2 (1.0-1.6 g) and IC9 before the second pass. No wave solder on the IC5 side.\nU5 profile: peak 230-245 C, 30-90 s above 217 C, soak 150-180 C 30-90 s, ramp up <= 3 C/s, down <= 6 C/s.\nThrough-hole parts IC3 (MagJack), J6, J7 and C20 by hand or selective solder after both reflow passes.\nL1: dot = pad 1 (+1V1).\nCM5: M2.5 screws from below (head <= 4.5 mm), nuts on the CM5 side; a nut under the board hits C20.\n\nTEST\nPoE isolation: 1500 V 10/700 us impulse test only, at normal air pressure. No 1500 Vrms or 2250 Vdc hipot\n(Y-caps C21/C24 and the module are not rated for it). Then >= 2 MOhm at 500 Vdc, primary to GND."
		(at 160 48.45 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "0297409f-4181-4257-b79e-0c4e3c6bd988")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Note: Rohrdurchmesser: 74,5mm\n      Max. PCB Länge: 110mm"
